    "title": "Vola Finance",
    "description": "Vola supplements your bank by sending money to prevent overdrafts, finding smart ways for you to save and helping you build your credit score.  \r\n\r\nOur unique algorithm advances your paycheck and better yet \u2013 lets you build up your score as you pay back your Vola advances. \r\n\r\nManaging multiple expenses, limited finances, and restrictive cash advance fees is hard.\r\n\r\nThat\u2019s why we built an app that covers all the bases.\r\n    * Provides overdraft protection- Lets you know when you\u2019re low on funds \r\n    * Gives you access to cash advances.\r\n    * Helps you track and manage expenses.\r\n\r\nGet the money you need today. \r\nBuild the savings, financial tracking and credit score you\u2019ll need tomorrow.",
